.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH wpaperctl 1  "wpaperctl 1.3.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
wpaperctl \- CLI for wallpaper manager wpaperd
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBwpaperctl\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
CLI for wallpaper manager wpaperd
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
wpaperctl\-get\-wallpaper(1)
.TP
wpaperctl\-all\-wallpapers(1)
.TP
wpaperctl\-next\-wallpaper(1)
.TP
wpaperctl\-previous\-wallpaper(1)
.TP
wpaperctl\-reload\-wallpaper(1)
.TP
wpaperctl\-pause\-wallpaper(1)
.TP
wpaperctl\-resume\-wallpaper(1)
.TP
wpaperctl\-toggle\-pause\-wallpaper(1)
.TP
wpaperctl\-get\-status(1)
.TP
wpaperctl\-set\-wallpaper(1)
Set wallpaper to a specific image file
.TP
wpaperctl\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v1.3.0
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
Danilo Spinella <danilo.spinella@suse.com>
